---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Question from '../components/Question.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About · Niko"
  description="Niko is a one-person side project from Nepal making simple, free Android apps for people mainstream apps leave out."
>
  <header class="hero">
    <h1>About Niko</h1>
    <p class="lead">Simple apps for people mainstream apps leave out.</p>
  </header>

  <main id="main">
    <section aria-labelledby="why">
      <h2 id="why">Why Niko</h2>
      <p>Most apps assume you can read, see the screen clearly and find your way through menus. Many people can't: people who never learned to read, older people, and people with low vision or other disabilities.</p>
      <p>Each Niko app does one everyday job, like telling the time or calling family, in a way they can use without help. It speaks out loud, works offline, and a family member or helper can set it up once.</p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="made">
      <h2 id="made">Who makes it</h2>
      <p>Niko is a one-person side project, made in Nepal. Much of the code is written with AI assistance, then reviewed and tested on real phones.</p>
      <p>Every app is free and published under GPLv3 when it is released. <a href="https://github.com/NikoApps">Niko on GitHub</a></p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="help">
      <h2 id="help">Help out</h2>
      <ul class="promise">
        <li><strong>Test an app</strong> with someone who would use it, and tell us what was hard.</li>
        <li><strong>Translate</strong> an app or check its spoken phrases in your language.</li>
        <li><strong>Report a problem</strong> on the app's GitHub page or by email.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="faq">
      <h2 id="faq">Questions</h2>

      <Question q="How is Niko paid for?">
        <p>It isn't. There are no ads, paid features or investors. It is a side project.</p>
      </Question>

      <Question q="Will the apps stay free?">
        <p>Yes. No ads and no paid features, ever.</p>
      </Question>

      <Question q="Can I suggest an app?">
        <p>Yes. Email with who it is for and the one job it should do.</p>
      </Question>

      <Question q="How quickly do you reply?">
        <p>Every message is read. Replies usually come within a week.</p>
      </Question>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="contact">
      <h2 id="contact">Contact</h2>
      <p><a href="mailto:hello@gopalkhadka.com.np">hello@gopalkhadka.com.np</a></p>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
